      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The august rooster can fly up to 40 feet on its turn, but it must start and end its movement on a solid surface such as a roof or the ground. If it is flying at the end of its turn, it falls to the ground and takes falling damage."
      ]
    },
